+`tests/at/suites/req-001/_pending.ts` - one in each slice's own change - because a leaf label
+sitting in that map with nothing pointing at it would be a claim that something is still pending
+when nothing is. That is the same rule earlier leaves applied to `LEAF.D1_L2`, `LEAF.D2_L1` and
+`LEAF.D2_L2`.
